# ============================================================
# .gitignore — ESP32 Truck Overtracking Warning System
# ============================================================

# ------------- OS / Editor -------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# ------------- Office temp files -------------
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pptx
~$*.doc
~$*.xls

# ------------- Build artifacts (Arduino) -------------
build/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.hex
*.uf2

# Arduino IDE 2.x build output
.ArduinoIDE/build/
.cache/
*.tmp.*

# ------------- MATLAB -------------
*.asv
*.m~
*.mat
*.fig
*.slxc
slprj/

# ------------- Python (for OpenMV / data tools) -------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# ------------- Logs / data captures -------------
logs/
!工具/*/logs/
工具/*/logs/*
!工具/*/logs/README.md
*.log
*.csv.bak
*.local.csv
data/raw/
*.bag

# TTC 复盘软件每次"导出 CSV"会落到这里，属于运行时日志，不入仓库
工具/TTC预警复盘软件/报警日志/*.csv

# 转弯全过程盲区分析软件：带时间戳的运行时导出（目标点/盲区日志），不入仓库。
# 但保留固定测试输入（如"标准测试用.csv"）。
工具/转弯全过程盲区分析软件/目标点CSV/turn_exit_boundary_targets_*.csv
工具/转弯全过程盲区分析软件/目标点CSV/turn_blindspot_boundary_targets_*.csv
工具/转弯全过程盲区分析软件/目标点CSV/*_旧版备份.csv
工具/转弯全过程盲区分析软件/边界点盲区日志/*.csv

# ------------- MATLAB demo run outputs -------------
# Each alpha-prediction sim folder has a runs/ subdir with timestamped outputs.
# Keep README, ignore the generated figures.
**/runs/*
!**/runs/README.md
!**/runs/.gitkeep

# ------------- Large model files -------------
*.tflite.bak
*.h5
*.onnx
*.pth

# ------------- Installers / binaries that slipped into the folder -------------
*.msi
*.exe
*.zip
*.7z

# ------------- Node / Electron (PID scenario desktop wrapper) -------------
node_modules/
desktop-dist/
npm-debug.log*
package-lock.json

# ------------- IDE / Sandbox workspaces -------------
# trae IDE working directory: keeps a sandboxed copy of files + node_modules.
# Useful artifacts (HTML / m / .md) are mirrored to repo root, so trae/ itself
# should never be committed.
trae/

# PID工具保留本地Electron依赖，代码和说明文件正常跟踪。
工具/PID工况仿真导出器/node_modules/
工具/PID工况仿真导出器/Matlab/scenarios/*.csv
!工具/PID工况仿真导出器/Matlab/scenarios/README.md
工具/CFG配置生成器/生成结果/*.json

# Windows shortcuts: hardcoded absolute paths, never portable, must not be tracked.
*.lnk

# ------------- AI agent runtime state -------------
# Anthropic / superpowers session state directories (contain ephemeral logs)
.superpowers/
.claude/
.cursor/

# ------------- PPT generation tools & outputs (do not track) -------------
开发资源/03_生成产物/PPT渲染/
开发资源/02_PPT制作/ppt_outline.md
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/audit_replica_v2_media.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/build_editable_ppt_inventory.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/build_editable_replica_v2.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/build_ppt_image2_editable_rebuild.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/make_ppt_geometry_reference.m
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/make_remaining_ppt_academic_figures.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/package_exact_origin_images_pptx.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/render_opening_report_images.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/sync_editable_asset_anchors.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/update_codex_ppt_deck_spec_slides_6_8.py
开发资源/01_生成脚本/tools/update_codex_ppt_deck_spec_slides_9_20.py
申报与答辩/01_答辩材料/26 小挑.pptx

# ------------- Defense speech renders (答辩演讲稿渲染产物) -------------
开发资源/03_生成产物/临时文件/docs/答辩演讲稿_render/
开发资源/03_生成产物/临时文件/docs/答辩演讲稿_含问答_render/
开发资源/03_生成产物/临时文件/pdfs/

# ------------- Opening report drafts / extracted text -------------
开发资源/03_生成产物/文本提取/
申报与答辩/02_开题材料/*开题报告*.docx
申报与答辩/02_开题材料/*开题报告*.pdf
申报与答辩/02_开题材料/主要研究内容_复制版.txt

# ------------- [DeepSeek] 实验运行时数据不入库（2026-10-22）-------------
